Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.40,0:00:06.50,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去寻找吧 收集起梦的碎片{\fad(250,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.41,0:00:17.61,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使胸中苦闷 去感受真切的现在吧{\fad(0,400)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.38,0:00:22.38,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比外表更单纯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.19,0:00:25.99,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是却无法传达
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.89,0:00:33.63,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想要说的话 总是藏在口袋里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.17,0:00:40.13,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,充满孩子气的话语 如今已无法开口
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.44,0:00:48.07,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽说时间会冲淡一切 我们却无法相互理解
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.35,0:00:54.38,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,24小时 一直相信着你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.45,0:00:58.12,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看着你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.12,0:01:02.65,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使只是俗常的话语
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.96,0:01:09.16,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,时间总是 微笑着匆匆流逝
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.24,0:01:20.63,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比起回忆 还是去追求理想的今天{\fad(0,1025)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.92,0:01:47.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么 我回家去了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.65,0:01:49.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听到了没 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.02,0:01:51.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,罗唆耶
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.36,0:01:52.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,赶快回去回去
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.26,0:01:56.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们每次回来 这里的时候就只会吵架
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.86,0:01:57.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么 枫姥姥
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.23,0:01:59.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,剩下的就拜托你了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.70,0:02:04.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 让她走掉行吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.87,0:02:07.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,关我啥事
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.78,0:02:13.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 犬夜叉那个大笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.45,0:02:17.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是因为担心他的身体
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.28,0:02:18.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,才会阻止打斗的说
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.45,0:02:20.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.19,0:02:23.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.42,0:02:25.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打消念头嘛 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.26,0:02:29.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉吃醋不是家常便饭吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.13,0:02:30.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.00,0:02:32.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是我的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.06,0:02:34.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉的心胸太狭窄了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.27,0:02:37.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,才会把钢牙的蠢话当真
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.64,0:02:41.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实他是个对自己 毫无自信的可怜虫
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.27,0:02:44.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这也代表着他是真的喜欢你
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.78,0:02:47.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你 七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.08,0:02:50.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是回去拿些药跟绷带
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.65,0:02:51.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很快就会回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.48,0:02:54.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过对犬夜叉要保密
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.52,0:02:58.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,偶尔也该让他担心一下
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.83,0:03:02.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道了 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.83,0:03:04.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要快点回来喔
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.60,0:03:14.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第47话 奈落残留的鬼蜘蛛灵魂
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.11,0:03:40.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落…有何贵干
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.55,0:03:43.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还是一样
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.85,0:03:45.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感觉这么敏锐 桔梗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.48,0:03:47.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么可能没发现
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.55,0:03:49.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且不只今天
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.06,0:03:53.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你已经不下数次 来查探我的情况了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.59,0:03:58.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好像很在意我嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.53,0:04:02.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么好笑的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.67,0:04:06.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落 你会在意我 也是身不由己的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.04,0:04:07.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.11,0:04:12.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为在你心中 鬼蜘蛛的心还强烈的残存着
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.05,0:04:21.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走了吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.40,0:04:36.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.34,0:04:38.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.34,0:04:39.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.41,0:04:41.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哎呀 回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.14,0:04:44.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要先用餐 还是先洗澡？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.28,0:04:48.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先洗澡吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.41,0:04:49.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看你这么累
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.52,0:04:52.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈现在就去准备
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.52,0:04:53.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢啦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.45,0:04:55.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了 好了 行李放下来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.02,0:04:59.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真不像是母亲和女儿的对话
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.59,0:05:02.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像是在外地就职的 上班族与妻子吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.67,0:05:14.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 这次要待几天呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.94,0:05:16.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,睡个觉就要回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.74,0:05:17.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了 草太
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.98,0:05:19.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把绷带跟外伤药拿出来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.62,0:05:27.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是床最棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.89,0:05:29.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉那家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.39,0:05:32.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就让他稍微担心一下好了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.91,0:05:52.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落 你会在意我 也是身不由己的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.21,0:05:53.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.41,0:05:59.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为在你心中 鬼蜘蛛的心还强烈的残存着
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.29,0:06:03.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明明随时都可以杀了那女人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.49,0:06:06.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会下不了手
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.03,0:06:08.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然是因为我奈落的体内
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.99,0:06:10.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还残留着对桔梗朝思暮想的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.73,0:06:13.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鬼蜘蛛的心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.73,0:06:15.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鬼蜘蛛的心…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.24,0:06:19.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个卑微的盗贼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.14,0:06:22.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使身体无法动弹
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.54,0:06:26.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对桔梗的非分之想却与日俱增
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.68,0:06:29.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最后将身体献给众多的妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.75,0:06:32.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而诞生出我奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.06,0:06:45.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那愚蠢人类的心
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.76,0:06:47.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对桔梗朝思暮想的心
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.77,0:06:51.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还残留在我奈落的身体里吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.54,0:07:00.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无聊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.28,0:07:03.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗 你真是太轻视我了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.78,0:07:06.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我奈落不是鬼蜘蛛
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.79,0:07:10.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在四魂之玉 已大致到手的现在
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.79,0:07:15.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鬼蜘蛛的心也等于无了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.33,0:07:54.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那团乌云是什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.33,0:07:57.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从刚才就停在寺院上面
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.40,0:07:59.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像很不吉利耶
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.61,0:08:10.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些光是…死魂
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.38,0:08:15.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它在吞噬着死魂
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.83,0:08:22.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是怎么搞的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.89,0:08:25.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是奈落所做的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.90,0:08:29.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗姑娘 您要做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.10,0:08:31.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思 马借我一下
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.97,0:08:32.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.25,0:08:46.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙打算吞尽 这块土地所有的死魂吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.29,0:08:48.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绝对不能让他得逞
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.02,0:09:25.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟了 死魂被抽出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.80,0:09:36.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再这样下去…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.21,0:09:44.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.29,0:10:03.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,法师 伤口的情况如何
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.33,0:10:05.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还会痛吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.50,0:10:07.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经舒服多了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.93,0:10:10.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这也是拜珊瑚 你们的照顾所赐
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.10,0:10:13.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是 奈落还有着 各式各样的分身
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.61,0:10:17.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是指兽郎丸和影郎丸吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.38,0:10:19.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的…第四个分身
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.88,0:10:23.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弟弟兽郎丸 只拥有战斗的意志
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.35,0:10:26.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,连奈落的命令都不服从
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.05,0:10:30.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算那只是傀儡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.09,0:10:34.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,却毫不犹豫砍下 己方奈落的脑袋
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.26,0:10:37.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,连奈落都难以掌控的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.86,0:10:40.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,潜伏在兽郎丸肚子里
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.97,0:10:43.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伺机攻击的哥哥影郎丸
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.60,0:10:44.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,同样非常残忍
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.97,0:10:47.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,的确是完全不知底细的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.37,0:10:51.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今后不知会出现怎样的敌人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.48,0:10:55.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,往后非得要更加谨慎小心了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.28,0:10:58.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.52,0:11:01.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还不打算 去接戈薇姑娘回来吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.99,0:11:02.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,罗唆耶
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.02,0:11:05.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙不在我还乐的清静咧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.79,0:11:10.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么你不要把气氛 搞的这么烦躁嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.66,0:11:11.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很累人耶
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.57,0:11:16.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇姑娘也是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.67,0:11:19.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真耐得住性子跟犬夜叉交往
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.80,0:11:21.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我深表认同
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.14,0:11:27.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是回去拿些药跟绷带
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.91,0:11:29.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很快就会回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.65,0:11:32.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过对犬夜叉要保密喔
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.69,0:11:35.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,偶尔也该让他担心一下呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.82,0:11:38.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经和戈薇约定好了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.82,0:11:39.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是别说吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.56,0:11:43.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大致上 怎么看 都是钢牙的单相思吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.40,0:11:46.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,根本就不用提心吊胆
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.40,0:11:49.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是吵死人了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.03,0:11:51.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闷不做声而已
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.44,0:11:53.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就好像全部都是我的错啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.47,0:11:56.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才不会道歉咧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.32,0:12:14.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇那个大浑蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.86,0:12:16.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要是不快点回来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.60,0:12:19.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不就变成大坏蛋了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.27,0:12:22.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我到底做了什么嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.24,0:12:28.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇真的生气了吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.97,0:12:31.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她现在在做什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.98,0:12:37.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖怪的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.49,0:12:43.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.39,0:12:45.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,巨大的死魂虫？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.66,0:12:50.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.13,0:12:52.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬…夜叉…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.03,0:12:55.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.74,0:13:03.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好严重的伤 这是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.24,0:13:05.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是奈落的毒蜂
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.64,0:13:07.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又是奈落搞的鬼吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.55,0:13:10.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里是…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.42,0:13:16.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打算解决桔梗吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.82,0:13:18.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我绝对不允许这种事
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.12,0:13:21.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎能让奈落杀害桔梗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.54,0:13:39.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗 我马上解决怪虫
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.64,0:13:41.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在这边静静等我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.85,0:13:43.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大怪虫
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.19,0:13:59.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,碰上我算你倒霉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.68,0:14:17.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接招吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.86,0:14:53.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有死魂 你就无法存活了吗…桔梗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.50,0:14:59.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.14,0:15:02.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬…夜叉…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.71,0:15:05.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么 你会在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.21,0:15:09.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才要问你呢 你怎么会…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.35,0:15:12.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我被妖怪赶来的…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.72,0:15:14.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以来这里找我帮忙的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.29,0:15:16.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少自负了 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.09,0:15:19.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是不知不觉中逃到这里的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.79,0:15:21.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.12,0:15:52.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经晚上了？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.29,0:15:55.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.96,0:15:58.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么不把我叫起来呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.46,0:16:00.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她还没睡醒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.07,0:16:08.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,五十年了呀
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.27,0:16:11.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么 你在想什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.21,0:16:16.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得 我们和五十年前一模一样
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.45,0:16:19.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别说傻话了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.95,0:16:24.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自从将你封印在此开始
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.09,0:16:27.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已经就变了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.69,0:16:29.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们因奈落的陷阱而彼此憎恨
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.73,0:16:33.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我被封印在 这棵树的五十年之间
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.10,0:16:35.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也死了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.37,0:16:41.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗 那么是我变了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.74,0:16:47.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在我知道奈落 那家伙的存在之前
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.01,0:16:49.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的确曾经恨过你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.41,0:16:52.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是 你不是也说过吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.62,0:16:54.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的命是属于你的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.62,0:16:57.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么你的命…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.76,0:17:01.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也是属于我的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.70,0:17:09.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,追根究底 你也和奈落一样
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.27,0:17:12.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我和奈落一样？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.27,0:17:14.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落的体内
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.14,0:17:17.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,确实残留着鬼蜘蛛的心
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.18,0:17:19.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鬼蜘蛛的心？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.71,0:17:24.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个盗贼一直 希望我成为他的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.35,0:17:29.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,特地指使我亲手除掉你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.55,0:17:33.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是受盗贼鬼蜘蛛 强烈的嫉妒心驱使
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.36,0:17:37.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嫉妒…为了那么一点小事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.06,0:17:39.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错 就这么点小事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.83,0:17:42.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然而…这就是人类
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.10,0:17:48.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落的体内 还残留着鬼蜘蛛的心
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.37,0:17:50.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等 桔梗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.71,0:17:52.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说奈落对你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.61,0:17:55.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他根本不想承认
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.21,0:17:59.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对我似乎还残留着思念这件事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.92,0:18:01.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了否定这种念头
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.59,0:18:04.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,才想要我消失的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.20,0:18:12.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,够了 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.00,0:18:16.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的体内已充满了死魂
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.93,0:18:18.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗 你…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.34,0:18:22.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打算一个人消灭奈落吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.44,0:18:23.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不能那么做
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.64,0:18:26.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那奈落居然迷恋着你…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.71,0:18:29.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恶心至极
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.49,0:18:36.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经这么晚了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.89,0:18:37.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.72,0:18:40.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉的脑袋也该冷静了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.96,0:18:43.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么光
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.64,0:18:59.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉跟桔梗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.58,0:19:01.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.15,0:19:03.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.75,0:19:05.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不在的这段时间
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.15,0:19:08.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你现在怎么想都无所谓
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.09,0:19:12.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但怎能将你交给奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.02,0:19:14.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能从奈落手中保护你的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.56,0:19:15.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有我而已不是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.66,0:19:18.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在发什么疯
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.06,0:19:21.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还不放开我
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.29,0:19:43.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一定会杀了奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.02,0:19:46.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你不需要再战斗了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.49,0:19:49.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就由我来保护
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.73,0:19:50.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.10,0:19:51.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.81,0:20:03.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.64,0:20:06.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,男人真是愚蠢的生物
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.14,0:20:10.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以为紧紧抱着 女人就是自己的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.38,0:20:11.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.95,0:20:12.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要动
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.08,0:20:15.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看到现在的你就更能了解了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.32,0:20:19.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要奈落仍有鬼蜘蛛的心
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.52,0:20:20.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,必定能趁虚而入
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.46,0:20:23.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那时正是净化奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.96,0:20:26.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让他从世上完全消失掉的时机
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.53,0:20:28.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.90,0:20:33.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.34,0:20:35.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.84,0:20:40.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,曾纠缠在一起的命运之线
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.18,0:20:42.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经无法复元了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.28,0:20:47.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.50,0:21:01.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嫉妒？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.03,0:21:06.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这也是鬼蜘蛛那龌龊人类的心
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.64,0:21:08.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无聊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.78,0:21:21.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个光是…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.09,0:21:23.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死魂
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.22,0:21:27.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗姐姐在这附近吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.31,0:21:49.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇…你看到了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.22,0:21:55.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉…他一直注视着我
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.55,0:21:56.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为何…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.15,0:21:59.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为何…你目不转睛的盯着我
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.49,0:22:29.27,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,何不把真正重要的事物以外{\fad(500,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.64,0:22:40.88,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全部 都舍弃呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.82,0:22:48.24,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现实 往往是如此残酷
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.22,0:22:51.78,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但每当 遇到这种时刻
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.09,0:22:56.26,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只要紧闭双眼
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.73,0:23:03.23,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,便能看见 你的笑容{\fad(0,900)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.34,0:23:11.01,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Ah- 但愿从此以往
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.75,0:23:18.65,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直到进入 沉眠的那一刻
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.22,0:23:25.92,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的 那抹笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.73,0:23:33.83,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都绝没有 消逝的瞬间{\fad(0,900)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.65,0:23:48.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下定决心保护桔梗的犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.89,0:23:50.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已经无法留在他身边了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.45,0:23:53.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么想的我 再度逃回了现代
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.66,0:23:55.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是四魂碎片还在我手上
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.19,0:23:58.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如此非得回战国时代才行
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.43,0:24:00.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是还给犬夜叉的话
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.30,0:24:02.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一切就真的结束了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.77,0:24:07.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,苦恼的我 站在第一次 遇见犬夜叉的神木之前
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.97,0:24:09.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,次回 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.47,0:24:12.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想回到相遇的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.61,0:24:13.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,敬请期待
